 stessa."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Beyond the Boundary: I'll Be Here – Future","overview":"The battle is over, and they can go about their normal lives now... or so they thought. With no time to rejoice after miraculously saving Mirai from Beyond the Boundary, Mirai lost all her memories. Akihito, now a high school senior, starts to avoid Mirai thinking it’s for the better. Not aware of Akihito’s feelings, Mirai tries to get closer to Akihito. Then, someone who knows of Mirai appears in front of the two. With Akihito’s troubles in vain, Mirai once again sets forth on a battle that forces her to look within."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"妖夢「境界の彼方」を体内に宿す半妖の神原秋人と、その「境界の彼方」を倒すことのできる唯一の存在である異界士・栗山未来。秋人と未来は惹（ひ）かれ合い、一緒に生きていく世界を選択する。ところが、戦いを終えた未来は記憶を失ってしまう。秋人は未来の幸せを願うゆえ、未来と関わらないようにするが、そんな秋人の思いとは裏腹に未来は秋人に接近し……。","tagline":"絆と愛、そして未来へーー。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4F5rRGppuuiwzIZAj9mEVkGDMTv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4F5rRGppuuiwzIZAj9mEVkGDMTv.png","language":"en","width":1000,"height":562},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/narxjQvI1An6OPzecROStQca8QF.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/narxjQvI1An6OPzecROStQca8QF.png","language":"en","width":788,"height":185}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qkXH0FuFEMVbEcX9ypFA9tQhlzl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qkXH0FuFEMVbEcX9ypFA9tQhlzl.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpOAXNRVfZwPi4AAFuasLjsyAnN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wpOAXNRVfZwPi4AAFuasLjsyAnN.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/leyjGBJyLW4zAICbJyaRJPaTEpN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/leyjGBJyLW4zAICbJyaRJPaTEpN.jpg","language":"en","width":1567,"height":2220},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.o